#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Derivations.rst:12
msgid "Clarifier Derivations"
msgstr "Derivaciones del clarificador"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Derivations.rst:15
msgid "Floc Filter Design"
msgstr "Diseño del filtro de flóculos"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Derivations.rst:19
msgid "Velocity Gradient"
msgstr "Gradiente de velocidad"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Derivations.rst:21
msgid ""
"The velocity gradient in the floc filter could cause some collisions between"
" particles. We demonstrate that this is NOT a significant effect below. The "
"velocity gradient in the floc filter is obtained from the head loss through "
"a fluidized bed. We will use Equation :eq:`G_Camp_Stein` to converts the "
"energy dissipation rate into a velocity gradient."
msgstr ""
"El gradiente de velocidad en el filtro de flóculos podría causar algunas "
"colisiones entre partículas. Demostramos que esto NO es un efecto "
"significativo a continuación. El gradiente de velocidad en el filtro de "
"flóculos se obtiene a partir del pérdida de carga a través de un lecho "
"fluidizado. Usaremos la Ecuación :eq:`G_Camp_Stein` para convertir la tasa "
"de disipación de energía en un gradiente de velocidad."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Derivations.rst:23
msgid "\\bar \\varepsilon = \\frac{gh_L}{\\theta}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Derivations.rst:27
msgid ""
"We will start by determining :math:`\\varepsilon` by calculating "
":math:`\\theta` using the porosity of the floc filter, :math:`\\phi_{ff}`,"
msgstr ""
"Comenzaremos determinando :math:`\\varepsilon` calculando :math:`\\theta"
"` usando la porosidad del filtro de flóculos, :math:`\\phi_{ff}`,"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Derivations.rst:29
msgid "\\theta = \\frac{H_{ff} \\phi_{ff}}{\\bar v_{z_{ff}}}"
msgstr ""

