msgstr ":math:`\\rho_{ff} =` densidad de filtro de flóculos"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Derivations.rst:124
msgid ""
"The mass of clay in the floc filter is concentration multiplied by volume, "
"shown by :math:`m_{clay} = C_{clay}\\forall_{ff}`"
msgstr ""
"La masa de arcilla en el filtro de flóculos se multiplica por el volumen, "
"mostrada por :math:`m_{clay} = C_{clay}\\forall_{ff}`"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Derivations.rst:126
msgid ""
"The mass of water in the floc filter is related to the volume fraction of "
"the floc filter that is occupied by clay, "
":math:`\\frac{C_{clay}}{\\rho_{clay}}`, whic is a very small number. "
":math:`\\left( 1 - \\frac{C_{clay}}{\\rho_{clay}} \\right)` is the fraction "
"of the floc filter that is occupied by water, also called the water volume "
"fraction. So, :math:`m_{H_2O} = \\left( 1 - \\frac{C_{clay}}{\\rho_{clay}} "
"\\right) \\rho_{H_2O} \\forall_{ff}`."
msgstr ""
"La masa de agua en el filtro de flóculos está relacionada con la fracc"
"ión volumétrica del filtro de flóculos que está ocupada por arcilla, :"
"math:`\\frac{C_{clay}}{\\rho_{clay}}`, que es un número muy pequeño. :ma"
"th:`\\left(1 - \\frac{C_{clay}}{\\rho_{clay}} \\right)` es la fracción del"
" filtro de flóculos que ocupa el agua, también llamada fracción volumé"
"trica de agua. Así, :math:`m_{H_2O} = \\left(1 - \\frac{C_{clay}}{\\rho_{"
"clay}} \\right) \\rho_{H_2O} \\forall_{ff}`."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Derivations.rst:128
msgid ""
"Now, we know how much clay and water is in our system. The density of the "
"system, neglecting the addition of coagulant, is,"
msgstr ""
"Ahora, sabemos cuánta arcilla y agua hay en nuestro sistema. La densidad del"
" sistema, descuidando la adición de coagulante, es,"

